<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy — TroyLabs" heading="Privacy Policy" description="How TroyLabs and the TL Alumni Network handle your information, including text messages." updated="October 6, 2026">
  <p>This is the TroyLabs Privacy Policy. TroyLabs is the University of Southern California's student startup accelerator. This policy covers usctroylabs.com and the TL Alumni Network (the members' directory at usctroylabs.com/alumni-portal), including TroyLabs text messages. Questions: <a href="mailto:troylabs@usc.edu">troylabs@usc.edu</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>What you enter on your profile: name, email addresses, phone number, graduation year, when you joined TroyLabs, divisions, city, LinkedIn link, bio, photo, startups and interests.</li>
    <li>Your work history and education from your public LinkedIn profile, imported after leadership approves you.</li>
    <li>Your choices about TroyLabs emails and texts, with when they changed, so we can honor them.</li>
    <li>Counts of how the site is used (page views, clicks, searches). These are totals, not tied to you.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To run the member directory, so TroyLabs members and alumni can find and contact each other.</li>
    <li>To send TroyLabs emails and texts about events and club news, only to members who turned them on.</li>
    <li>To review and approve new members.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who can see it</h2>
  <p>Your profile, including your contact details, is visible to approved TroyLabs members and to TroyLabs leadership. It is not public. We do not sell your information.</p>
  <p>We use service providers to run the site, only for that purpose: Supabase (database and sign-in), Resend (email), Twilio (text messages), Vercel (hosting and page-view counts), PostHog (usage counts), Apify (reading public LinkedIn profiles) and OpenAI (search by meaning; only work details are sent, never names, emails or phone numbers).</p>

  <h2>Text messages (SMS)</h2>
  <p>Members who add a mobile number when they sign up get TroyLabs texts about events and club news. You can turn them off on your profile at any time. <strong>We do not sell or share your SMS opt-in data or personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</strong> Mobile phone numbers and text opt-in data are not shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any text to stop them; reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help. See the <a href="/terms">text message terms</a>.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can edit or remove your information on your profile at any time, and turn TroyLabs emails or texts off there. To delete your account, email <a href="mailto:troylabs@usc.edu">troylabs@usc.edu</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
